UI PLAYER 1 is down!
UI Press F to revive PLAYER 1 (uses a medkit)
CALL rk XApplyEffectOnPlayer Nola_ReviveNoBag
LOG NOLA LIFE: parceiro caido ao alcance: efeito Nola_ReviveNoBag aplicado (F reanima e nao abre o inventario) ok=true
LOG NOLA LIFE: itens de reanimar (Item.WoundedHeal): 3
CALL itemRemove P Medkit 1 -> true
OUT inv Medkit=3
OUT #RV:0,0,0
UI_CLEAR revprompt
CALL mh XRemoveEffectFromPlayer Nola_ReviveNoBag
LOG NOLA LIFE: inventario no F liberado (fora do contexto de reanimar, F solto): efeito Nola_ReviveNoBag retirado ok=true
OUT #RV:0,0,0
OUT inv Medkit=3
OUT #RV:0,0,0
UI Revive result unknown: no refund. You can revive again.
LOG NOLA REVIVE: payment released after 16 s seq=0 item=Medkit phase=4
UI Press F to revive PLAYER 1 (uses a medkit)
CALL rk XApplyEffectOnPlayer Nola_ReviveNoBag
LOG NOLA LIFE: parceiro caido ao alcance: efeito Nola_ReviveNoBag aplicado (F reanima e nao abre o inventario) ok=true
CALL itemRemove P Medkit 1 -> true
LOG NOLA LIFE: REANIMAR: F perto de PLAYER 1 caido (100 cm): 1 Medkit consumido (tinha 2), pedido #1 para pid 1 enviado
UI Reviving PLAYER 1…
OUT inv Medkit=1
OUT #RV:1,0,1
